<% page_title "Playground" %>
<% page_description "Self-hosted AI tools that ran on one GPU, plus browser tools that still work: pitch checker, MIDI studio, Claude Corner." %>

<h1>Playground</h1>
<p class="lede">Things I built for fun. Some still run in your browser. The AI tools ran on a GPU at my place in California, and they've been offline since I moved to New York, so each one has a write-up of how it worked instead.</p>
<p>The engineering behind them, and what broke, is in <%= link_to "austn.net's GPU tools", work_item_path("austn-net") %>.</p>

<h2 class="section-title">works right now</h2>
<ul class="rows">
  <% @items.reject(&:gpu?).each do |item| %>
    <li>
      <a class="row" href="<%= playground_item_path(item) %>">
        <span class="row-when"><span class="status status--live">live</span></span>
        <span class="row-title"><%= item.title %></span>
        <span class="row-summary"><%= item.summary %></span>
      </a>
    </li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<h2 class="section-title">ran on my GPU</h2>
<ul class="rows">
  <% @items.select(&:gpu?).each do |item| %>
    <li>
      <a class="row" href="<%= playground_item_path(item) %>">
        <span class="row-when"><span class="status">offline</span></span>
        <span class="row-title"><%= item.title %></span>
        <span class="row-summary"><%= item.summary %></span>
        <% if item.model %><span class="row-stack"><%= item.model %></span><% end %>
      </a>
    </li>
  <% end %>
</ul>
